      "customData": {
        "section": "6-vocab",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          6979.2,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "26,204 − 16,032 = 10,172: the local row on GPU 1",
      "originalText": "26,204 − 16,032 = 10,172: the local row on GPU 1",
      "fontSize": 32,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b6o"
    },
    {
      "id": "6-vocab-485",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7049.2,
      "width": 1029.6000000000001,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#141414",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 614784181,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 524242452,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792906735648,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "6-vocab",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          7049.2,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "every GPU looks up every token; outside its range it writes zeros,\nso the sum is the one real row",
      "originalText": "every GPU looks up every token; outside its range it writes zeros,\nso the sum is the one real row",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b6p"
    },
    {
      "id": "6-vocab-486",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 6979.2,
      "width": 1201.2,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#141414",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1325053144,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1907576108,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792906735648,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "6-vocab",
        "anchor": [
          1300,
          6979.2,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "the output projection splits the same way: each GPU scores its 16,032 tokens,\nthen an all-gather builds all 128,256 logits for the loss",
      "originalText": "the output projection splits the same way: each GPU scores its 16,032 tokens,\nthen an all-gather builds all 128,256 logits for the loss",
      "fontSize": 30,
